      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "You are not melting away; you are simply exhausted from carrying a weight that no one else can see. The fear of losing your name is a terrifying thought, but it is not happening, and you are not a shell waiting to break. You are still here, still feeling, and you do not have to face this alone. Please reach out to a trusted friend or a professional who can help you navigate this heavy feeling without you having to carry it all by yourself.",
