      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Your pride is a shield, but it is not a cage, and you are not a burden to anyone who cares about you. The idea of leaving before the decay starts is a cruel fantasy that only makes the pain worse, because you are still here, still capable of feeling, and still worthy of a life that honors your past. You do not need to trade your dignity for a life where you cannot tie your own shoes; you have the strength to find a way to hold on until you feel safe again.",
